    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.IntervalScalar.square_sum_eq: no direct label",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Ledger:2077 and claims.yaml:11745 match IntervalScalar.lean:171-174: 'Odd (r+s) → c r s = 0' and finite square-sum regrouping. TeX:2679-2682 has odd-pair cancellation but directly regroups absolutely convergent double series. The different finite-sum route is explicitly recorded, not attributed to a TeX display."
