    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.IntervalScalar.static_interaction_step: E:static-interaction",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Ledger:2085 and claims.yaml:11801 match IntervalScalar.lean:420-433. Lean's 'hY0 : ‖Y 0‖=N', displayed hY, 'Odd(r+s) → inner=0', hborn and hmean correspond respectively to TeX:2664,2673-2679,2667-2669 and2095-2101. The constants, λh≤1 and α range agree. The real-Hilbert abstraction, unused α>0 and missing interaction-map identification are explicitly disclosed."
