    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.IntervalScalar.dgamma_nonneg: no direct label",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Ledger:2091 and claims.yaml:11843 match IntervalScalar.lean:598-600: any measure Γ and 'alpha<2' give nonnegativity of '(3−alpha)*Γ(B1).toReal/(4π)*(2^alpha+3^(2−alpha)/(2−alpha))'. TeX:1989-1991 defines D_Gamma by exactly these factors. Correct auxiliary classification."
