    {
      "claim": "StratonovichHAMSecondMoment.IntervalScalar.InventoryProduct: E:inventory-product",
      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Ledger:2098 and claims.yaml:11892 match IntervalScalar.lean:707-710: '∀ M k,1≤k → coeff k (prod j:Fin M …(j+1))≤C^k/(k!)^(3−alpha)'. TeX:2920-2924 chooses C independently of M,k and gives the same bound. The row correctly distinguishes this predicate from a theorem and identifies its later discharge."
