      "verdict": "PASS",
      "reason": "Ledger:2111 and claims.yaml:11983 match IntervalScalar.lean:991-1005. Lean's 'hsplits : coef=Σκ Σp Q p' matches TeX:3405-3415 after parity; 'hfixed : |Q p|≤k² Cs^k R^k V prod splitFactor' matches TeX:3009-3016 after the stated cutoff identification; 'hinv' matches TeX:2921-2924. The inventory hypotheses match2973. The constant 12=4·3 and all exponents match3426-3474."
