      "reason": "Ledger:2115 and claims.yaml:12011 match IntervalScalar.lean:1200-1215. Lean assumes H:homog, R's formula, 'C,V≥0', T>0, hodd,h0,hcoef,henergy. TeX:2747,3410-3412,3497-3506 supplies the same formula and scalar facts. The exponent '(3−α) C^(1/(3−α)) R^(1/(3−α)) T^(β/(3−α))' matches the explicitly absorbed constant at3505."
